\">北</style>へ伸びています！","female":"マスターの予想通りです……ここの地下の腐敗は、<style=\"highlight\">北</style>へ伸びています！","variant_male_record_index":"106751","variant_female_record_index":"106752","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1011512007:0":{"text":"……ですが、イミルが流光の樹を腐敗させる目的はいったい？","source_cn":"……伊米尔腐化流荧树，究竟能得到什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D2690E3DC4B7DD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1011512008:0":{"text":"彼はすでに人望も、駒となる武力も、皆に尊敬される地位も手にしています。","source_cn":"他已经有人望，有可操控的武力，有备受尊崇的地位。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61BDB26DEB59A065","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1011512009:0":{"text":"もし真相がバレたら、彼はそのすべてを失ってしまうというのに。","source_cn":"真相一旦败露，他反而会身败名裂，一无所有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x389E12A5E81F7690","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1011512010:0":{"text":"あのじいさん、三派閥の共同統治が気に食わなくて、ユグドラシルを牛耳るつもりか！？","source_cn":"那老头，难道看不惯三派共治，想把薄暮丛林的一切都掌握在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7975FDA2C392A8E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1011512010":{"text":"あのじいさん、三派閥の共同統治が気に食わなくて、ユグドラシルを牛耳るつもりか！？","source_cn":"那老头，难道看不惯三派共治，想把薄暮丛林的一切都掌握在自己手里吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7975FDA2C392A8E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1011512012:0":{"text":"くっ！もっと早くあいつの企みを知っていれば！","source_cn":"混蛋！要是我们早一点发现他在干什么就好了！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35C2A797F519A079","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1011512013:1":{"text":"クイン、今は悔しがってもしょうがないわ。イミルがこんなことをするなんて、誰にも想像できないわよ。","source_cn":"洛桑，现在不是自艾自怜的时候，伊米尔会做出这种事情，任...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x507047CB94EE95A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1011512014:1":{"text":"私たちにできるのは、ここで挫けずに踏ん張ること。","source_cn":"我们现在能做的，是要打起精神。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5333132BEE11ED24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1011512015:1":{"text":"イミルの計画を知っていて、それを止められる者はもう私たちしかいないの！","source_cn":"知晓阴谋，而且能够阻止伊米尔的，只有我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x702A1E9AC3A5A215","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1011512016:0":{"text":"姉さん……","source_cn":"姐姐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x273FF2E6DDBAC42D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:30:1011512016":{"text":"姉さん……","source_cn":"姐姐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x273FF2E6DDBAC42D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1011512017:1":{"text":"ええ、ですがやはりイミルが森を腐敗させようとする動機が分かりません……","source_cn":"嗯，但不知道伊米尔腐化丛林的动机究竟为何……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5F9CA6D500011D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1011512018:1":{"text":"ここの腐敗も記録しておきました。これからどうしますか？このまま流光の樹に向かいますか？","source_cn":"这处腐化地点已记录下来。后续我们要如何行动？要继续前往...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6CA7CFDF452E0EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1011512019:0":{"text":"待ってください！あそこ、何かが飛んで来ました！","source_cn":"等一下，你们看——有东西飞过来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AAC7C28BAB39E9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:36:1011513001:":{"text":"エルーナです。","source_cn":"是艾洛娜","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F555E66B2E28DB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinemati